          "name": "Amazon S3 Create Multi-region Access Point",
          "request": {
            "name": "Amazon S3 Create Multi-region Access Point",
            "description": {
              "content": "Creates a Multi-Region Access Point and associates it with the specified buckets. Multi-Region Access Points provide a single global endpoint that applications can use to request data regardless of the location of the requester. This is an asynchronous request.",
